# Playwright's own run artefacts. The fixture store under `apps/e2e/tests/mocks`
# is deliberately *not* here: those files are the answer the tests assert on, and
# a fixture nobody can review is the failure this package exists to prevent.
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
.playwright

# graphify's derived and machine-local output. `graph.json`, `manifest.json`,
# `GRAPH_REPORT.md` and the curated `.graphify_labels.json` are deliberately
# *not* here: AGENTS.md tells agents to query the graph when `graph.json`
# exists, so a fresh clone that has to rebuild first is a graph nobody uses.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/graph.html
graphify-out/cost.json
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/.graphify_root
# Dated snapshots of the previous graph, written on every rebuild.
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
